+# [MP8] ======== Mixed rooms: who runs Extended, and Extended's own calls ========
+# Godot sends an RPC as its index in the node's sorted RPC table, so the game's scripts keep exactly the
+# game's @rpc methods and Extended's calls go through the relay at /root/MP8Net (the wrapper's
+# mp8_net.gd), which reaches only peers whose join data carries our tag (multiplayer_backend.gd).
