+
+# True on the couch, and online while every player among the connected peers runs this Extended.
+# Peers, since Offline Bots adds its bots to connected_players online without our key; and only peers
+# with a player entry, since a peer mid-handshake or being refused has none yet.
+# Held from each minigame's load to its clear (game.gd, D118): a mid-match joiner gets its entry at once
+# and waits in the join queue, and the minigame was set up for the room at its load.
+func mp8_room_extended() -> bool:
+	if GameManager.local_game or active_backend == null:
+		return true
+	if _mp8_room_latch >= 0:
+		return _mp8_room_latch == 1
+	return _mp8_room_live()
