+# Whether this peer sends a broadcast that Extended sends from the server only (a sound, a cleanup): in a
+# mixed room every peer sends it, as the game does (D116). is_server is an argument for mp8_selftest.
+func mp8_sends_broadcast(is_server: bool) -> bool:
