+# [MP8] The join rules, asked by both backends after the game's own version check. -1 accepts; otherwise
+# the RefuseReason to send. Above the cap, vanilla's own spectator rule at MAX_PLAYERS still applies.
+func mp8_join_refusal(network_id: int, client_data: Dictionary) -> int:
